00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.020
to try to make it a good video.

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:16.300
Cause-cause we could not put that up and go

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.460
"Here ya go everybody! This is funny, right?"

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.280
*forced fake laughter*

