00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:27.560
"We know it was not good!"

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:28.320
So anyway

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:30.900
That is uh.. that is the story of that.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:34.140
But oddly enough! That's the way that uh, Ethan

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.680
was telling me about the other video

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:38.340
Uh, the one that we did put up, the Don't Laugh Challenge that we did.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:41.420
Because Ethan told me, "This video's not funny either.."

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:43.840
