00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:46.100
And we could not catch out breaths

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.300
Because we were laughing so hard

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.460
It was so incredibly funny to us.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:54.000
Because it was the perfect blend of awkward cringeyness

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.140
with ACTUAL funnyness

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:59.420
Just the spontaneity and the improvisation of it

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:00.860
makes for a really fun video.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:03.040
And that's why I love those types of videos.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.400
But that does not mean that I won't be doing Try Not to Laugh Challenge

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.640
which is gonna come again very soon.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:10.720
I've got a stock pile of videos, I just gotta go through em again.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:14.540
Maybe I'll just to incorporate a "You Guys" component to that too

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:17.120
but I don't know! There's a lot of holiday stuff coming up

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:20.400
but we do aim to get out there with you guys a lot more.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:22.720
So! That is the wrap up for this week.

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:24.960
We've had just a ton of fun.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:27.480
An-and I'm super happy with the way things have been going

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.720
because I've been more motivated than ever

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.060
to just get videos done

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:35.400
An-I-I'm hon- I'm like honored that I've got so many cool people around me that

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:36.840
wanna push me to be better and

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.960
and uh make better videos

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:41.420
and just get out there and do stuff everyday

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:42.840
and try new things.

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:45.360
I don't regret trying this new thing!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:47.520
I don't regret trying.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:49.440
Even if it turns out to be bad.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:51.780
I do not regret trying.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:53.920
And that's something that I would encourage you guys

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:54.740
to go out and do.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:57.180
Because, in this regard, we failed.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:02.060
But fear of failure shouldn't be something that dissuades you from trying new things

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:05.460
and going out there and expanding your horizons.

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:08.960
Because you never know what's actually going to work

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:11.040
until you go out there and do it.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:13.540
And I guarantee there's some people that are funnier than we are

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:15.380
that could've made that work.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.380
Just...not us.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:18.620
And not then.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:19.560
So either way

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:21.860
Thank you everybody so much for watching.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.040
Look forward to another charity livestream next month

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:25.740
with even more friends

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.580
it should be super awesome and hopefully back in Cincinnati.

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:33.340
AND look forward to Bob and Wade coming out here to visit very soon.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:36.080
So, thank you again everybody for watching!

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:39.300
And as always, I will see YOU in the next video.

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.200
Buh Bye!

